 "source_instruction": "i'm looking for a white case for iphone 12 with american flag printed and wireless charging",
 "query": "Ugh, I swear the barista at my usual morning spot remembered my order wrong for the third time this week today\u2014 I asked for an oat milk latte with just one pump of vanilla, extra hot, and they handed me something iced with three pumps of hazelnut that tasted like straight candy syrup. I was already running late because my cat decided to knock over my entire stack of mail right as I was heading out the door, scattering junk flyers and a couple of bills all down the front steps, so I didn\u2019t even have time to wait for them to remake it. I ended up chugging half of it on the walk to the bus stop anyway, and now I\u2019ve got that jittery too-much-sugar feeling that makes me feel like I\u2019m bouncing off the walls a little. Hey, I\u2019m browsing the iPhone accessories section right now and need something that supports solar panel charging for my phone, can you help me pull up the right picks? I want to go with that one color I always grab for my phone gear, you know the one I mean. Don\u2019t show me anything over my set budget, I already know how much I\u2019m willing to spend so just stick to that limit when you filter options. I don\u2019t need any extra fancy add-ons beyond what I mentioned, just the basic stuff that matches what I\u2019m looking for.",
